OL,3,GNEWSAFriends' love of nature shared in
OL,4,AYouTube films
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo aspiring wildlife presenters have
OL,7,Fstarted their own YouTube series aimed
OL,8,Fat celebrating nature in the West
OL,9,FMidlands.
OL,11,FRyan Eddowes, from Wolverhampton, and
OL,12,FAdam O'Hare, from Birmingham, said they
OL,13,Fwanted to the spread the word about the
OL,14,Fbenefits of seeking out nature on your
OL,15,Fdoorstep in their Wild West Midlands
OL,16,Ffilms.
OL,18,FThe friends have been working on their
OL,19,Fsecond short film in Pendeford Nature
OL,20,FReserve, near Wolverhampton.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
